      "margin_text": ", (a) with respect to Loans, Reimbursement Obligations and the L/C Fee, (i) during the Amendment Period the rates per annum determined in accordance with Schedule 1C plus 0.50% and (ii) thereafter the rates per annum determined in accordance with Schedule 1C and (b) with respect to the Commitment Fee, the rate per annum determined in accordance with Schedule 1C. “Application” is defined in Section 2.3(b). ",
