          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "Ultimate Parent shall not permit the Interest Coverage Ratio to be less than, (i) for the Computation Period ending December 31, 2023, 1.75 to 1.00 and (ii) for the Computation Period ending December 31, 2024, 2.00 to 1.00."
        },
        {
          "type": "leverage",
          "limit": 3.5,
          "unit": "x",
