          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "“Amendment Period End Date” means the first date Administrative Agent receives financial statements required to be delivered pursuant to Sections 6.5(a) or (b) and a Compliance Certificate demonstrating both (a) a Total Net Leverage Ratio of no greater than 3.50 to 1.00 and (b) an Interest Coverage Ratio of no less than 3.00 to 1.00."
